                                "sense_id": "c408ee96-5e47-312f-96e2-fa33911504ce",
                                "text": "Tatiana went from working the pulley that lifted the treadless tank and placed it on tread, to painting the red star on a finished tank ready to be flatbedded and put into production."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2da345f3-155b-48de-a1ac-9f15fc4d42b4",
                                "sense_id": "c408ee96-5e47-312f-96e2-fa33911504ce",
                                "text": "'Well, we won't know about prints till we can flatbed his SUV back to Middle Street and check, but given he left the car in a hurry, my guess is we'll find something, maybe quite a lot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8942b086-31d9-453a-84d5-8279291fffb4",
                                "sense_id": "c408ee96-5e47-312f-96e2-fa33911504ce",
                                "text": "“I'm going to have to flatbed this vehicle,” Larry said with an air of importance that irritated Pytel."
